  "targetQuestionId": "JEE-Main-2026-04-02-Shift-1-Paper1-QID-69112126",
  "targetQuestionText": "If (1/2)ε₀E² has dimensions MᵃLᵇTᶜ, what is 2a − b + c? Here ε₀ is vacuum permittivity and E is electric field.",
